{%- comment -%}
  Damon Program Studio — MVP (Phase 1, rules-only).
  5-step wizard with live preview pane that renders a generated program.
  All recommendation logic is deterministic and lives in the inline JS below.
  AI-insight callouts are templated rule outputs.

  Phase 2 will add a Cloudflare Worker + Claude Haiku for genuinely
  AI-generated insight prose; the contract for the recommender stays the same.
{%- endcomment -%}

<section class="studio-page">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="studio-page__eyebrow">✦ Damon AI · Program Studio</span>
    <h1 class="studio-page__title">Build your <em>cleaning program</em>.<br>4 questions, 90 seconds, ships Monday.</h1>
    <p class="studio-page__sub">Damon Program Studio takes your facility profile and generates a complete program — chemistry, dispensers, training, and a quarterly walk-through — with every line item priced and a savings analysis vs. your current vendor.</p>

    <div class="studio">
      <div class="studio__pane">

        <!-- LEFT: BUILDER -->
        <div class="studio-builder">
          <div class="studio-stepper" data-stepper>
            <span class="studio-step-pill is-active" data-step-pill="1"><span class="studio-step-pill__dot">1</span> Industry</span>
            <span class="studio-step-pill__arrow">›</span>
            <span class="studio-step-pill" data-step-pill="2"><span class="studio-step-pill__dot">2</span> Size</span>
            <span class="studio-step-pill__arrow">›</span>
            <span class="studio-step-pill" data-step-pill="3"><span class="studio-step-pill__dot">3</span> Compliance</span>
            <span class="studio-step-pill__arrow">›</span>
            <span class="studio-step-pill" data-step-pill="4"><span class="studio-step-pill__dot">4</span> Refine</span>
            <span class="studio-step-pill__arrow">›</span>
            <span class="studio-step-pill" data-step-pill="5"><span class="studio-step-pill__dot">★</span> Build</span>
          </div>

          {%- comment -%} ---------- STEP 1 — Industry ---------- {%- endcomment -%}
          <div class="studio-screen is-active" data-screen="1">
            <h2>Step 1 · What kind of facility?</h2>
            <p class="lead">Pick the closest match. Damon Program Studio uses this to pick a base program archetype.</p>
            <div class="studio-qrow">
              <div class="studio-qrow__q">Industry</div>
              <h4>Choose one</h4>
              <div class="studio-opts">
                <button type="button" class="studio-opt" data-input="industry" data-value="healthcare-ppd"><span class="studio-opt__icon">⚕</span>Healthcare</button>
                <button type="button" class="studio-opt" data-input="industry" data-value="food-processing"><span class="studio-opt__icon">🥩</span>Food processor</button>
                <button type="button" class="studio-opt" data-input="industry" data-value="qsr"><span class="studio-opt__icon">🍔</span>Quick serve</button>
                <button type="button" class="studio-opt" data-input="industry" data-value="schools"><span class="studio-opt__icon">🎓</span>Schools</button>
                <button type="button" class="studio-opt" data-input="industry" data-value="grocery-meat"><span class="studio-opt__icon">🥓</span>Grocery / meat</button>
                <button type="button" class="studio-opt" data-input="industry" data-value="industrial"><span class="studio-opt__icon">🏭</span>Industrial</button>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          {%- comment -%} ---------- STEP 2 — Size ---------- {%- endcomment -%}
          <div class="studio-screen" data-screen="2">
            <h2>Step 2 · How big is the facility?</h2>
            <p class="lead">Drag to set a rough size. Studio uses this to scale quantities.</p>
            <div class="studio-qrow">
              <div class="studio-qrow__q">Size</div>
              <h4 data-size-label>Approximate size</h4>
              <div class="studio-slider-row">
                <input type="range" min="1" max="5" step="1" value="3" data-input="size">
                <span class="studio-slider-row__v" data-size-display>Mid-size</span>
              </div>
              <div class="studio-slider__bounds">
                <span>Small (single location)</span>
                <span>Multi-site / 100k+ sqft</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="studio-qrow">
              <div class="studio-qrow__q">Estimated monthly chemistry budget</div>
              <h4 data-budget-label>This is just for reference — Studio will not exceed it.</h4>
              <div class="studio-slider-row">
                <input type="range" min="200" max="5000" step="100" value="1200" data-input="budget">
                <span class="studio-slider-row__v" data-budget-display>$1,200/mo</span>
              </div>
              <div class="studio-slider__bounds">
                <span>$200</span>
                <span>$5,000+</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          {%- comment -%} ---------- STEP 3 — Compliance ---------- {%- endcomment -%}
          <div class="studio-screen" data-screen="3">
            <h2>Step 3 · Compliance &amp; goals.</h2>
            <p class="lead">What does this program need to do — beyond cleaning? Pick all that apply. Studio will tune the chemistry.</p>
            <div class="studio-qrow">
              <div class="studio-qrow__q">Standards</div>
              <h4>Standards your program must meet</h4>
              <div class="studio-check-grid">
                <button type="button" class="studio-check" data-input="compliance" data-value="cms-jc"><span class="studio-check__box">✓</span> CMS / Joint Commission</button>
                <button type="button" class="studio-check" data-input="compliance" data-value="usda"><span class="studio-check__box">✓</span> USDA food contact</button>
                <button type="button" class="studio-check" data-input="compliance" data-value="green-seal"><span class="studio-check__box">✓</span> Green Seal / EcoLogo</button>
                <button type="button" class="studio-check" data-input="compliance" data-value="epa-reg"><span class="studio-check__box">✓</span> EPA registered claims</button>
                <button type="button" class="studio-check" data-input="compliance" data-value="hsc"><span class="studio-check__box">✓</span> Healthy Schools Campaign</button>
                <button type="button" class="studio-check" data-input="compliance" data-value="leed"><span class="studio-check__box">✓</span> LEED documentation</button>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          {%- comment -%} ---------- STEP 4 — Refine ---------- {%- endcomment -%}
          <div class="studio-screen" data-screen="4">
            <h2>Step 4 · Special considerations.</h2>
            <p class="lead">Optional — these tune the chemistry, equipment, and training in your program.</p>
            <div class="studio-qrow">
              <div class="studio-qrow__q">Special considerations</div>
              <h4>Pick what applies</h4>
              <div class="studio-opts">
                <button type="button" class="studio-opt" data-input="special" data-value="night-shift"><span class="studio-opt__icon">⏰</span>Night shift use</button>
                <button type="button" class="studio-opt" data-input="special" data-value="robotic"><span class="studio-opt__icon">🤖</span>Robotic scrubber</button>
                <button type="button" class="studio-opt" data-input="special" data-value="food-service"><span class="studio-opt__icon">🍽</span>Has food service</button>
                <button type="button" class="studio-opt" data-input="special" data-value="pediatric"><span class="studio-opt__icon">👶</span>Pediatric / sensitive</button>
                <button type="button" class="studio-opt" data-input="special" data-value="bulk-disp"><span class="studio-opt__icon">⚗</span>Bulk dispensing</button>
                <button type="button" class="studio-opt" data-input="special" data-value="training"><span class="studio-opt__icon">📚</span>Training needed</button>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="studio-prompt">
              <h4>✦ Anything else Studio should know?</h4>
              <textarea rows="3" data-input="notes" placeholder='Optional — example: "We had a Listeria scare in February, want to add an extra Q-San rotation."'></textarea>
              <div class="studio-prompt__chips">
                <button type="button" class="studio-prompt__chip" data-prompt-add="Outbreak history: ">+ Outbreak history</button>
                <button type="button" class="studio-prompt__chip" data-prompt-add="Inspector preferences: ">+ Inspector preferences</button>
                <button type="button" class="studio-prompt__chip" data-prompt-add="Dispenser brand: ">+ Dispenser brand</button>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          {%- comment -%} ---------- STEP 5 — Build (summary on left) ---------- {%- endcomment -%}
          <div class="studio-screen" data-screen="5">
            <h2>Step 5 · Your program is ready.</h2>
            <p class="lead">Review the live preview on the right. Save it, export to PDF, or activate AutoStock to ship Monday.</p>
            <div class="studio-qrow">
              <div class="studio-qrow__q">Summary</div>
              <h4>What we built</h4>
              <p style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--ink-2); margin: 0;" data-summary-text>—</p>
            </div>
            <div class="studio-qrow">
              <div class="studio-qrow__q">Next steps</div>
              <h4>Three ways forward</h4>
              <ul style="font-size: 13px; padding-left: 16px; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--ink-2); margin: 0;">
                <li><b style="color: var(--red);">Activate AutoStock</b> — locks pricing 12 months, first shipment goes out Monday.</li>
                <li><b style="color: var(--red);">Save program</b> — keep this configuration on file. We'll email a copy.</li>
                <li><b style="color: var(--red);">Talk to a rep</b> — for a formal walk-through, custom kitting, or Net-30 setup.</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="studio-builder__footer">
            <button type="button" class="studio-builder__back" data-step-back disabled>← Back</button>
            <button type="button" class="studio-builder__next" data-step-next>Continue · build program ✦</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- RIGHT: LIVE PREVIEW -->
        <div class="studio-preview" data-preview>
          <div class="studio-preview__empty" data-preview-empty>
            <h2>Pick an industry to start.</h2>
            <p>Studio will draft a starting program in seconds. Tweak from there.</p>
          </div>

          <div data-preview-built hidden>
            <div class="studio-preview__top">
              <span class="studio-preview__live">Live preview</span>
              <h3>Program · Generated by Studio</h3>
            </div>
            <h2 class="studio-preview__title" data-program-title>—</h2>
            <p class="studio-preview__desc" data-program-desc>—</p>

            <div class="studio-insights" data-program-insights></div>

            <div class="studio-program-grid" data-program-grid></div>

            <div class="studio-roi">
              <h4>✦ ROI · projected</h4>
              <div class="studio-roi__grid">
                <div class="studio-roi__cell"><span class="v" data-roi-monthly>—</span><span class="l">Monthly · locked 12 mo</span></div>
                <div class="studio-roi__cell"><span class="v"><span class="red" data-roi-pct>—</span></span><span class="l">vs. typical vendor</span></div>
                <div class="studio-roi__cell"><span class="v" data-roi-annual>—</span><span class="l">Annual savings</span></div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="studio-savebar">
              <div class="studio-savebar__label">
                <span>Program total</span>
                <b data-program-total>$0 / month</b>
              </div>
              <div class="studio-savebar__actions">
                <button type="button" class="studio-savebar__btn studio-savebar__btn--ghost" data-program-pdf>↓ PDF</button>
                <button type="button" class="studio-savebar__btn" data-program-save>Save program</button>
              </div>
            </div>

            <button type="button" class="studio-checkout" data-program-checkout>
              Activate AutoStock &amp; add to cart →
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

